        "created_at": "2015-07-06T19:26:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>A. Yes, but you won't be able to put anything into play from your hand.</p><p>B. &nbsp;Same as A since you don't have a hand.</p><p>C. Yes. &nbsp;The only effect will be drawing a card if there are no valid targets to destroy.&nbsp;</p>",
