        "raw": "<p>A. Yes, but you won&#39;t be able to put anything into play from your hand.</p><p>B. &nbsp;Same as A since you don&#39;t have a hand.</p><p>C. Yes. &nbsp;The only effect will be drawing a card if there are no valid targets to destroy.&nbsp;</p>",
