        "id": 144561,
        "name": "Ameena",
        "username": "Ameena",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-07-06T19:27:45.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Let's see…I think the text for \"Load\" just says \"Play a card\", doesn't it? So you would <span class=\"bbcode-i\">have</span> to play <span class=\"bbcode-i\">something</span>, and if you ever try to play a Limited card that's already in play, the new one goes to the trash and never manages to enter play. So I suppose using that power when you have no applicable cards would basically amount to \"discard a card\".</p>\n<p>I would also expect that you can activate the power when there are no cards in hand - it just wouldn't do anything.</p>\n<p>And Grappling Hook can be played, I'm sure, if there are no ongoing or environment cards to destroy. Note that there is no \"may\" about this card - you <span class=\"bbcode-i\">must</span> destroy something if there is something to destroy, even if that means taking out a fellow hero's ongoing card. If there are absolutely no environment or ongoing cards in play then you would just skip to \"You may draw a card\", at which point you can choose whether or not to do that (as it says \"may\").</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:22:10.425Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
