        "raw": "Let&#39;s see...I think the text for &quot;Load&quot; just says &quot;Play a card&quot;, doesn&#39;t it? So you would [i]have[/i] to play [i]something[/i], and if you ever try to play a Limited card that&#39;s already in play, the new one goes to the trash and never manages to enter play. So I suppose using that power when you have no applicable cards would basically amount to &quot;discard a card&quot;.\n\nI would also expect that you can activate the power when there are no cards in hand - it just wouldn&#39;t do anything.\n\nAnd Grappling Hook can be played, I&#39;m sure, if there are no ongoing or environment cards to destroy. Note that there is no &quot;may&quot; about this card - you [i]must[/i] destroy something if there is something to destroy, even if that means taking out a fellow hero&#39;s ongoing card. If there are absolutely no environment or ongoing cards in play then you would just skip to &quot;You may draw a card&quot;, at which point you can choose whether or not to do that (as it says &quot;may&quot;).\n",
