        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-07-06T19:42:33.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The only way a Limited card can attempt to come into play is from cards that put cards into play from top or bottom of your deck. &nbsp; In those cases the card goes into the trash. &nbsp;If you only have Limited cards in your hand and they are already in play then you have no valid cards to play. &nbsp;</p>",
